{"id":"ccbc12:problem:b-metab","answer":"RINGMASTER","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>观察小题答案的首尾字母。</p>","text":"观察小题答案的首尾字母。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>注意蛇身上的黑色部分，尤其注意蛇头和蛇尾都有黑色。</p>","text":"注意蛇身上的黑色部分，尤其注意蛇头和蛇尾都有黑色。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>通过观察，发现可以把本区所有小题答案按照某个顺序排列成一个圈，使得每一个答案的最后一个字母和下一个答案的第一个字母相同。通过旋转这一圈答案，可以使得每一个答案和蛇身的某一段长度相同。</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>2063</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>R</span><span>ED CHIL</span><span>I</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>2001</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>I</span><span>SAAC NEWTO</span><span>N</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>1747</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>N</span><span>ATIONAL SON</span><span>G</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>1989</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>G</span><span>UNDA</span><span>M</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>2016</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>M</span><span>USIC MEDI</span><span>A</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>1982</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>A</span><span>BNORMALITIE</span><span>S</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>1942</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>S</span><span>UBTLE POIN</span><span>T</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>2058</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>T</span><span>HE DUK</span><span>E</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>1834</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>E</span><span>DITO</span><span>R</span><span></span></section></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-fb7a8ffa5401c117256643c8\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/b-meta.jpg\"/></p>\n<p>按顺序两个相邻答案共用的字母（也就是对应蛇身上黑色部分的字母）提取出答案：<strong>RINGMASTER</strong>。</p>\n<p>（注意开头和结尾的两个字母是分开来的，也就是说这个答案自己衔接着自己）</p>","text":"通过观察，发现可以把本区所有小题答案按照某个顺序排列成一个圈，使得每一个答案的最后一个字母和下一个答案的第一个字母相同。通过旋转这一圈答案，可以使得每一个答案和蛇身的某一段长度相同。\n\n2063\nR\nED CHIL\nI\n2001\nI\nSAAC NEWTO\nN\n1747\nN\nATIONAL SON\nG\n1989\nG\nUNDA\nM\n2016\nM\nUSIC MEDI\nA\n1982\nA\nBNORMALITIE\nS\n1942\nS\nUBTLE POIN\nT\n2058\nT\nHE DUK\nE\n1834\nE\nDITO\nR\n\n按顺序两个相邻答案共用的字母（也就是对应蛇身上黑色部分的字母）提取出答案：\nRINGMASTER\n。\n\n（注意开头和结尾的两个字母是分开来的，也就是说这个答案自己衔接着自己）","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-fb7a8ffa5401c117256643c8"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>“谢谢你救我出来！”sonic挠了挠头，“今年是哪一年了？我被困在幻境的时间太长了……关键这个幻境只有蛇啊！对了，我的其他队友是不是也被困住了，事不宜迟，我们休息9天就去救他们吧！”</p>","text":"“谢谢你救我出来！”sonic挠了挠头，“今年是哪一年了？我被困在幻境的时间太长了……关键这个幻境只有蛇啊！对了，我的其他队友是不是也被困住了，事不宜迟，我们休息9天就去救他们吧！”","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-fb7a8ffa5401c117256643c8","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/b-meta.jpg","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/b-meta.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":88712,"sha256":"8b2182791672e49cac01a3a26d445076bc1486ed6c699c1d4b37c90db2792f8c","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
